{"id":243,"date":"2009-09-25T09:52:16","date_gmt":"2009-09-25T09:52:16","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/?p=243"},"modified":"2015-04-24T23:20:19","modified_gmt":"2015-04-24T22:20:19","slug":"les-vieux-magazines-revivent","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/2009\/09\/25\/les-vieux-magazines-revivent\/","title":{"rendered":"Les vieux magazines revivent!"},"content":{"rendered":"<figure style=\"width: 120px\" class=\"wp-caption alignright\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"http:\/\/upload.wikimedia.org\/wikipedia\/commons\/thumb\/0\/0e\/Logo_abandonware.png\/120px-Logo_abandonware.png\" alt=\"logo de l abandonware\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">logo de l&#39; &quot;abandonware&quot;<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>Ne jetez plus vos vieux magazines d&rsquo;informatique! Scannez-les et envoyez-les \u00e0 <a href=\"http:\/\/www.abandonware-magazines.org\/\" target=\"_blank\">abandonware-magazines.org<\/a>. Ce site collectionne les tr\u00e8s vieux num\u00e9ros de Micro-Syst\u00e8mes, l&rsquo;Ordinateur Individuel et autres Soft&amp;Micro. A part faire couler une petite larme nostalgique en relisant le test complet du TRS-80 ou du VIC-20, ce site contribue \u00e0 pr\u00e9server l&rsquo;histoire de l&rsquo;informatique.<\/p>\n<p>La notion d&rsquo;<a href=\"http:\/\/fr.wikipedia.org\/wiki\/Logiciel_abandonn%C3%A9\" target=\"_blank\">abandonware <\/a>est surtout appliqu\u00e9e dans le domaine du logiciel, o\u00f9 certains consid\u00e8rent qu&rsquo;un\u00a0 logiciel de plus de 10 ans qui n&rsquo;est plus commercialis\u00e9 ni support\u00e9, et donc ne rapporte plus d&rsquo;argent \u00e0 ses auteurs, peut \u00eatre mis \u00e0 disposition gratuitement. C&rsquo;est un peu limite du point de vue du droit d&rsquo;auteur qui prot\u00e8ge les \u0153uvres jusqu&rsquo;\u00e0 70 ans apr\u00e8s la mort de leurs auteurs, mais c&rsquo;est tol\u00e9r\u00e9&#8230;<\/p>\n<p>Le site des vieux jeux, c&rsquo;est <a href=\"http:\/\/www.abandonware-france.org\/\" target=\"_blank\">l\u00e0<\/a>. Bon, je retourne faire quelques tableaux de <a href=\"http:\/\/www.abandonware-france.org\/ltf_abandon\/ltf_jeu.php?id=5\" target=\"_blank\">Lemmings <\/a>: la version Win95 tourne tr\u00e8s bien sur ma b\u00e9cane Windows Seven 64 bits. On pondait du code bien foutu, \u00e0 l&rsquo;\u00e9poque&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Ne jetez plus vos vieux magazines d&rsquo;informatique! Scannez-les et envoyez-les \u00e0 abandonware-magazines.org. Ce site collectionne les tr\u00e8s vieux num\u00e9ros de<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":37,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"colormag_page_container_layout":"default_layout","colormag_page_sidebar_layout":"default_layout","footnotes":""},"categories":[166],"tags":[12],"class_list":["post-243","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-microclub","tag-histoire"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/243","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/37"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=243"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/243\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1760,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/243\/revisions\/1760"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=243"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=243"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\